@startuml
title UC6 - Manage Staff Accounts

start

:Select Manage Staff Accounts;
:Choose create / update / delete;

if (Select operation?) then (Create)
  :Enter staff details;
  :Create staff account;
else (not Create)
  if (Update?) then (Update)
    :Select staff account;
    :Modify staff details/permissions;
    :Save updated staff account;
  else (Delete)
    :Select staff account to delete;
    :Remove staff account;
  endif
endif

:Display updated staff list;

stop

note right
  Activity Description:
  1. Admin selects the Manage Staff Accounts option.
  2. Admin chooses to create, update, or delete a staff account.
  3. System evaluates which operation was selected.
  4. If Create is selected, admin enters the staff details.
  5. System creates the new staff account.
  6. If Update is selected, admin selects an existing staff account.
  7. Admin modifies staff details and/or permissions.
  8. System saves the updated staff account.
  9. If Delete is selected, admin selects a staff account to delete.
  10. System removes the selected staff account.
  11. System displays the updated list of staff accounts.
end note

@enduml